    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">She-Ra and the Crystal Gems: Fallen Horizons</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Even after saving both their worlds from destruction, there is still so much for both the Crystal Gems and the Princess Alliance to accomplish. But even with their war reaching an end, evil has not yet been vanquished. A secret threat, laying dormant for centuries, is finally prepared to enact a plan that will put the entire universe at risk. New powers, secret origins, new allies, old enemies...but that's just par for the course! Nothing they can't handle...right?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>TheInkredibleKaptainKaiju</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
